    "identifier": "uchiha-uchiha-ember-bullet",
    "description": "<p>You fill your lungs with fire release chakra enough to exhale smoke from your nostrils before expelling a beam of flame. Make a ranged Ninjutsu attack against a target in range, dealing 4d6+4 fire damage on a hit and forcing them to make a Constitution saving throw, being Burned on a failed save.</p>\n<p>Off-Guard. An off-guard creature that takes damage from this jutsu is surrounded by flames. If they move more than 5 feet during their next turn, they take 3d6 fire damage.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and damage by 1d6+1.</p>",
